msgctxt "quest/047/AktKct203_04769:TEXT_AKTKCT203_04769_SYSTEM_000_001:1"
msgid "Please note that upon completing the quest “A Tool without Compare,” you will receive an upgraded splendorous tool for your current class of <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0>."
msgstr "Обратите внимание: после завершения задания «Инструмент вне сравнений» вы получите улучшенный великолепный инструмент для текущего класса — <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0>."

#. ja: <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0>のモーエンツールを改良しますか？
#. de: Den Auftrag als <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0> annehmen?
#. fr: Voulez-vous améliorer l'outil <if ($gn4 == 0)><if ($gn68 == 5)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 6)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 7)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 10)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 11)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 14)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 26)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 27)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 28)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 33)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else>de <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if><else><if ($gn68 == 5)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 2><else><if ($gn68 == 6)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 2><else><if ($gn68 == 7)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 2><else><if ($gn68 == 10)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 2><else><if ($gn68 == 11)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 2><else><if ($gn68 == 14)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 2><else><if ($gn68 == 26)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 2><else><if ($gn68 == 27)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 2><else><if ($gn68 == 28)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 2><else><if ($gn68 == 33)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 2><else>de <sheet ClassJob $gn68 2></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if><nbsp>?
